      "id": "FAM:SF-APPS-087",
      "status_as_recorded": "rejected",
      "finding": "Connector presence does not shield stars (dTS +0.05 pp p=0.937, dTO wrong sign p=0.00364). Connector on-off PPP null (mean -0.041 p=0.939, median +0.528 p=0.731, n=73). Lineup lift disappears after talent control (p=0.51)."
