  "own_inferences": [
    "The question can be operationalized as: among players classified as Shapers in season T, compare the pre- to post-move change in structural influence (L_pre, or persistence of Shaper classification) between those whose initiation share from CUT play types exceeds some threshold and those whose DRIVE share exceeds a threshold.",
