        "code": "MEASURE_RELIABILITY",
        "text": "Threshold-based definitions of cut-heavy/drive-heavy from play-type classification may be unreliable for low-possession role players, and change in structural influence is a noisy outcome."
      }
    ]
  },
  "prior_work": {
    "already_answered": "no",
    "cited": [],
    "summary": "No previous study in the retrieved set addressed this question; the project has studied Shapers only at the lineup-coverage level, not their individual role portability across teams."
